---

# 🌎 useContext

Compartilha dados globalmente.

Criando contexto:

```jsx
import { createContext } from "react";

export const AuthContext =
  createContext();
```

---

Provider:

```jsx
<AuthContext.Provider
  value={{ usuario }}
>
  {children}
</AuthContext.Provider>
```

---

Consumindo:

```jsx
const { usuario } =
  useContext(AuthContext);
```

