# 🌍 Consumindo APIs

Utilizando Fetch.

```jsx
useEffect(() => {
  async function buscarUsuarios() {
    const response = await fetch(
      "https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users"
    );

    const dados =
      await response.json();

    console.log(dados);
  }

  buscarUsuarios();
}, []);
```

